# No environment file is tracked in this directory. The repository gate
# (tools/check-sensitive-files.mjs) refuses any .env* path missing from its
# NAME_CHECK_EXEMPT allowlist, and this one is deliberately absent from it:
# README.md documents every variable the app reads, so a tracked example would
# be a second copy to keep in sync.
.env*
